&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Last 300 seconds input rate: 0 bytes/sec, 0 bits/sec, 0 packets/sec
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Last 300 seconds output rate: 0 bytes/sec, 0 bits/sec, 0 packets/sec
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Input: 12 packets, 1100 bytes, 0 drops
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Output: 12 packets, 1100 bytes, 0 drops
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">[SW-A]
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>查看Switch A上的VSI信息，可以看到VSI内创建的VXLAN、与VXLAN关联的VXLAN隧道、与VSI关联的以太网服务实例等信息。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">[SW-A]dis l2vpn vsi verbose
