&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> Tunnel2 0x5000002 UP Manual Disabled
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ACs:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> AC Link ID State Type
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> GE1/0/2 srv1000 0 Up Manual
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">[SW-A]
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>查看Switch A上VSI的MAC地址表项信息，可以看到已学习到的MAC地址信息。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">[SW-A]dis l2vpn mac-address
